catflow 0.8
1. Read Text   outline.md                                   ; ctx+
2. Split       by=headings   text -> [text]
3. <each write_section>   [text] -> [text]
     1. Draft   (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "Write this section in full." ; ctx ; ctx+
4. Join Text   separator="\n\n"
5. Save Text   report.md

